---
layout: base.njk
title: "Play an H5P activity"
bodyClass: play-page
description: "An H5P activity an AI chat wrote, built and played in your browser, with its .h5p file to download. Nothing is sent to a server."
# Not a page to land on from a search: it is opened with an activity's source in its link.
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
# As the build page's policy: packages it built play in the player's frame, under the policy the
# player's Service Worker gives each response there.
csp: "default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: blob:; font-src 'self'; connect-src * data: blob:; worker-src 'self' blob:; frame-src 'self' blob:; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'"
---
{#- The player alone, for an activity's source in the link (#source=, as the build page takes it),
    so that a chat app can show the activity in its reply: play-page.ts builds it and plays it. -#}
<main class="play" id="main" data-state="building">
  {#- What a screen reader is told of each step; what is seen is drawn below. -#}
  <p class="visually-hidden" id="status" role="status" data-state="building">Building the activity in your browser…</p>
  <div class="play-stage" id="stage">
    <div class="player-box" id="player-box" hidden>
      <h5p-player id="player"></h5p-player>
    </div>
    {#- Over the player until it is ready: one of the three below. -#}
    <div class="play-panel" id="panel">
      <div class="play-loader" id="loader">
        <span class="play-spinner" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <p class="play-label" id="label">Building the activity in your browser…</p>
        <div class="play-progress" id="progress" role="progressbar" aria-label="Getting the file" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" hidden><span id="progress-bar"></span></div>
        <p class="play-note" id="note">Nothing is sent to a server.</p>
        <button type="button" class="button" id="instead" hidden>Choose it from your computer instead</button>
      </div>
      {#- For a source that names files of the person's own, a video beside it: chosen here or
          dropped, they stay in the browser. The field is hidden, and the button opens it. -#}
      <div class="play-ask" id="files-box" hidden>
        <svg class="play-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 16V4M7 9l5-5 5 5M5 20h14"/></svg>
        <h1 class="play-heading" id="ask-title">Add your file</h1>
        <p class="play-text" id="ask-text"></p>
        <button type="button" class="button button-solid button-large" id="choose">Choose the file</button>
        <p class="play-note">or drop it here</p>
        <input type="file" id="files" multiple hidden>
      </div>
      <div class="play-error" id="error" hidden>
        <svg class="play-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 8v5M12 16.5v.5M10.3 3.9 2.6 17.5A2 2 0 0 0 4.3 20.5h15.4a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-3L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0Z"/></svg>
        <h1 class="play-heading" id="error-title"></h1>
        <p class="play-text" id="error-text"></p>
        <a class="button button-solid button-large" id="fix" target="_blank" rel="noopener" hidden>Open in the build page</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="play-bar">
    <div class="play-about">
      <p class="play-title" id="title"></p>
      <p class="play-meta" id="meta"></p>
    </div>
    <p class="play-actions">
      <a class="button" id="edit" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Open in the build page</a>
      <a class="button button-solid" id="download" download hidden><svg class="button-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4v12M7 11l5 5 5-5M5 20h14"/></svg><span id="download-label">Download .h5p</span></a>
    </p>
  </div>
  {#- Download of an activity whose video plays from the chat: its bytes come first, while it plays on. -#}
  <div class="play-keep" id="keep" hidden>
    <div class="play-keep-text">
      <p class="play-keep-label" id="keep-label"></p>
      <div class="play-progress" id="keep-progress" role="progressbar" aria-label="Getting the file for the download" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100" data-indeterminate><span id="keep-bar"></span></div>
    </div>
    <button type="button" class="button" id="keep-instead">Choose it from your computer instead</button>
  </div>
</main>
<script type="module" src="/h5p/play/play-page.js"></script>
